<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Hayley's Christmas List</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(#b30024, #ff5f7f);
      color: white;
    }

    nav {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      padding: 1rem 2rem;
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem 1rem;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    section {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 2rem auto;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
      padding: 2rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }

    h2 {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .category {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 15px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
    }

    .category h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    ul {
      padding-left: 1.2rem;
    }

    li {
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <nav>
    <a href="index.html">⬅ Back to Family Lists</a>
  </nav>

  <header>
    <h1>🎀 Hayley's Christmas List 🎁</h1>
    <p>Here are Hayley's gift wishes organized by category!</p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <div class="category">
      <h3>💄 Makeup & Beauty</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Makeup brushes</li>
        <li>Eyeshadow palette</li>
        <li>Skincare set</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="category">
      <h3>👗 Clothes</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Winter sweater</li>
        <li>Boots</li>
        <li>Gold necklace</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="category">
      <h3>🪩 Room Decor</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>LED lights</li>
        <li>Throw pillows</li>
        <li>Wall posters</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="category">
      <h3>🧦 Stocking Stuffers</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Mini perfumes</li>
        <li>Chocolate</li>
        <li>Small keychains</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

</body>
</html>
